## Phase 6: Sentinel Guard & High-Frequency Risk

The **Sentinel Guard** is a high-frequency risk monitoring service that watches open positions for breaking news and technical shocks.

### Features Implemented:
- **SentinelService:** Scans news headlines (via DDGS) every 60 seconds for critical keywords like "fraud", "probe", "order win", etc.
- **High-Impact Alerts:** WebSocket-driven sticky modals for danger/success news events.
- **Volatility-Aware Polling:** Dynamically triggers AI scans if a stock moves >2% in 5 minutes.

### Technical Details:
- **Service Hub:** [services/sentinel_service.py](file:///home/sakthi/Trading/gemini_nse_trader/services/sentinel_service.py)
- **Background Loop:** [background_engine.py](file:///home/sakthi/Trading/gemini_nse_trader/background_engine.py) (Integrated Step 6 & 7)
- **Frontend Alerting:** [static/js/app.js](file:///home/sakthi/Trading/gemini_nse_trader/static/js/app.js) ([showSentinelAlert](file:///home/sakthi/Trading/gemini_nse_trader/static/js/app.js#929-948))

